# Ignore transient .claude/ files but keep project skills tracked (they ship with repo).
# Using .claude/* (not .claude/) so git can traverse into the skills subdir.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
MATLAB/Multi_init_cond/Datasets/
MATLAB/Multi_init_cond/Untitled
Obsolete/
*.log
*.asv

# Python build/cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# PX4_Gazebo run-time artifacts
PX4_Gazebo/run_logs/
PX4_Gazebo/calibration_data/
# (calibration_data/ holds both output/ and input/ subtrees)

# PX4_Gazebo/test_data: bulk recordings (regenerable) are ignored.
# Tracked subdirs (irreplaceable — SP landings, reference reps, campaign records):
#   CoordDescent/ ImpulseResponse/ Interventions/ Krp4/ NewDefaults/ RhoFov05_KP125/
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/Landing_Test/
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/ICValidation/
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/KLT_AB/
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/NewCal/
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/Test_Videos/
# HybridFlow_AB: bulk A/B reps ignored EXCEPT hybrid_rep5 (SP #5, the 5th
# soft+precise landing ever — achieved on the hybrid-flow arm 2026-05-29).
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/HybridFlow_AB/*
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/HybridFlow_AB/20260529-133034/
PX4_Gazebo/test_data/HybridFlow_AB/20260529-133034/*
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/HybridFlow_AB/20260529-133034/hybrid_rep5/
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/HybridFlow_AB/20260529-133034/hybrid_rep5.log
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/HybridFlow_AB/20260529-133034/summary.tsv
# per-rep console logs inside the TRACKED campaign dirs ARE wanted (override
# *.log) — scoped PER-DIR so the ignored bulk reps' logs are NOT pulled in
# (the blanket !test_data/**/*.log leaked the HybridFlow A/B bulk-rep logs).
# hybrid_rep5.log is re-included above via its own carve-out (line 34).
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/CoordDescent/**/*.log
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/ImpulseResponse/**/*.log
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/Interventions/**/*.log
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/Krp4/**/*.log
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/NewDefaults/**/*.log
!PX4_Gazebo/test_data/RhoFov05_KP125/**/*.log

# Phase 1 sentinel files (transient; do not commit)
MATLAB/Datasets/Phase1/done.flag
